sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Learner as 学习者
    participant Entry as index.html / app.js
    participant Catalog as BookCatalog
    participant Router as Router
    participant Ctrl as StudyController
    participant Planner as SessionPlanner
    participant SRS as SRSEngine
    participant Store as StateStore
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant IDB as IDBBackup
    participant Remote as LocalDaemonSync
    participant Server as serve.py /api/state
    participant UI as ViewRenderer
    participant TTS as TTSService

    Note over Entry,Remote: 初始化：保留 classic script 顺序与 file:// 双击能力
    Entry->>Catalog: __init__(window.BOOKS, window.DEFAULT_BOOK)
    Entry->>Store: __init__(IDBBackup, LocalDaemonSync)
    Store->>LS: getItem(shici.state.v1)
    alt 原始 JSON 损坏
        Store->>LS: setItem(shici.state.v1.corrupt.timestamp, raw)
        Note over Store,LS: 不覆盖原始键，保持可导出与人工恢复
    else 有效 V3 或旧字段可归一化
        LS-->>Store: version/profile/words/activity/bookSeeds/meta
        Store->>IDB: hydrate(local)
        IDB-->>Store: newer candidate 或 no-op
    end
    opt 仅 localhost 且 /api/state 可用
        Store->>Remote: probe() 与 read()
        Remote->>Server: GET /api/state
        Server-->>Remote: 原始 V3 JSON 或 404
        Remote-->>Store: 候选快照
        Note over Store,Remote: 新版本需防分叉，不得以时间戳单独覆盖本地
    end
    Entry->>Catalog: loadBook(activeBookId, scriptPayload)
    Catalog-->>Entry: 按 wordId 索引，curated 与 wenyan 共享 ID
    Entry->>Router: __init__(UI, Store)
    Router->>UI: renderHome(Store.getOverview())
    UI-->>Learner: #home

    Note over Learner,Store: 创建/读取/更新：7 词微循环与题目即时提交
    Learner->>Ctrl: startSession(daily)
    Ctrl->>Planner: buildDailyPlan(state, localDay)
    Planner-->>Ctrl: 最多七个 QueueItem
    Ctrl->>Planner: start(daily, queue, now)
    Planner-->>Ctrl: StudySession(phase=cards)
    loop 每张卡，包括 again 引发的一次队尾重现
        Ctrl->>UI: renderSession(session)
        Ctrl->>TTS: speakWord(word)
        UI-->>Learner: 卡片、揭示和自评
        Learner->>Ctrl: revealCard() / rateCard(again|fuzzy|known)
        Ctrl->>Store: answerWord(id, rating, seconds)
        Store->>SRS: answerWord(record, rating, seconds, now)
        SRS-->>Store: WordProgress 与到期日期
        Store->>LS: setItem(shici.state.v1, full V3 state)
        alt localStorage 成功
            Store-->>Ctrl: 已在 L1 持久化
            Store->>IDB: writeCurrent(snapshot) 异步备份
        else localStorage 失败
            Store->>IDB: writeCurrent(snapshot) 并等待结果
            alt IDB 也失败
                Store-->>Ctrl: 不得宣称已保存，保留内存并提示导出
            end
        end
        opt 本机服务可用
            Store->>Remote: write(state) 去抖 450ms
            Remote->>Server: POST /api/state 原始状态
            alt POST 失败
                Remote-->>Store: degraded；8s 重试且 30s 补偿
            else POST 成功
                Server-->>Remote: ok/savedAt
            end
        end
    end
    Ctrl->>UI: renderSession(quiz)
    UI-->>Learner: 客观提取题
    Learner->>Ctrl: answerQuiz(option)
    Ctrl->>Store: recordObjectiveAnswer(id, options)
    Store->>SRS: recordObjectiveAnswer(record, options, now)
    SRS-->>Store: 自评与客观证据分离
    Store->>LS: setItem(shici.state.v1, full V3 state)
    Store->>IDB: writeCurrent(snapshot)
    Ctrl->>Store: recordSession(summary)
    Store->>LS: setItem(shici.state.v1, full V3 state)
    Ctrl->>UI: renderSession(summary)
    Learner->>Router: navigate(#report)
    Router->>UI: renderReport(Store.getReportViewModel())
    UI-->>Learner: 阅读报告（只读）

    Note over Learner,Store: 删除只允许明确确认的 resetAll；导入/导出是显式操作
    opt 用户确认重置或导入
        Learner->>Store: exportState()
        Store-->>Learner: 保留完整 JSON 备份
        Learner->>Store: resetAll() 或 importState(raw)
        Note over Store,LS: 先留可恢复快照；失败不得删原数据
    end
    opt pagehide / visibilitychange
        Store->>Remote: flush(state)
        Remote->>Server: sendBeacon /api/state（best effort）
    end
